WEBVTT

00:13:28.573 --> 00:13:30.536
bound for somewhere west.

00:13:31.479 --> 00:13:34.213
Right after takeoff,
a slight change in course

00:13:34.237 --> 00:13:38.293
is the difference between landing
in Alaska or Fiji.

00:13:39.678 --> 00:13:44.871
Likewise, at 21 or 25 or even 29,

00:13:44.895 --> 00:13:47.673
one good conversation, one good break,

00:13:47.697 --> 00:13:50.980
one good TED Talk,
can have an enormous effect

00:13:51.004 --> 00:13:54.373
across years and even generations to come.

00:13:55.762 --> 00:13:57.588
So here's an idea worth spreading

00:13:57.612 --> 00:13:59.753
to every twentysomething you know.